  "description": "Why are human relationships so difficult?\n\nSo-Gom is dumped by Hong-Ju, a friend of ten years. Shocked by being shunned even by her own social circle, she reflects on her past and resolves to become a new person. However, at the company she joined on her professor's recommendation, she happens to run into Hong-Ju again, and her nightmarish relationships continue into the workplace. People keep their distance from So-Gom, wary of Hong-Ju. Amidst this, the only coworker who reaches out to her first is Go-Yeong. Seriously, how can you not fall for her at this rate?! Will So-Gom be able to overcome her past wounds and forge a new bond with Go-Yeong? And will she be able to avoid ruining her relationships this time? A relatable comedic drama capturing the wounds, growth, excitement, and laughter of relationships that everyone has experienced at least once.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
